					"content": "…你有看到迪盧克先生…哦，就是今天的酒保先生，他剛才出過門嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660716,
					"content": "啊，糟了！居然問其他客人…這下要露餡了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660717,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660718
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4660718,
					"content": "哦，老爺他…啊，不不，迪盧克先生他一直在櫃檯，哪裡也沒去過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "傑克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660719,
					"content": "這樣啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660720,
					"content": "霍夫曼先生，這是你之前點的蒲公英酒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660721,
					"content": "喝了它早點回去吧，代我向騎士團的各位問好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660722,
					"content": "啊…不用了，我現在著急回騎士團覆命，這杯就敬給您吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660723,
					"content": "…呼…真是奇怪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660724,
					"content": "呼哇…剛才真是嚇死了，我還以為肯定露餡了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660725,
					"content": "這點我早有預想，所以…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660726,
					"content": "…今天除了你們之外，所有客人都是晨曦酒莊過來的自己人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660727,
					"content": "全都是暗樁嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660728,
					"content": "不是所有哦…嚴格來說，是「除我以外」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660729,
					"content": "是凱亞！你怎麼在這裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660730
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660730,
					"content": "只是挑了個可以安安靜靜看戲的好位置而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660731,
					"content": "難道…從一開始你就在了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660732,
					"content": "沒錯，這部「暗夜英雄的不在場證明」真是精彩，比美酒還要醉人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660733
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660733,
					"content": "哼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660734,
					"content": "然後呢？你準備把這些都報告給騎士團？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660735
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660735,
					"content": "哈哈哈…你應該瞭解我的，我對告密的事可沒什麼興趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660736,
					"content": "只是單純想要知道，蒙德的「暗夜英雄」可以做到什麼程度…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660737
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660737,
					"content": "果然，永遠不會讓人失望。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660738
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660738,
					"content": "我還不需要向你證明什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660739
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660739,
					"content": "那是自然。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660740
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660740,
					"content": "但最讓我意外的是，孤高的「暗夜英雄」居然也會接受別人的幫助…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660741
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660741,
					"content": "抱歉本店已經打烊了，客人你請回吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660742
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660742,
					"content": "好了好了，今晚我已經不需要酒來助興了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660743
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660743,
					"content": "不過在離開前，我還有句話想說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660744
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660744,
					"content": "那就最後一句。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660745
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660745,
					"content": "迪盧克，你有了這個「助手」，我可是感到了一種奇妙的安心啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660746
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660746,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660747
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660747,
					"content": "祝願你們有一個美妙的夜晚，回頭見。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660748
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660748,
					"content": "凱亞的意思是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660749
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660749,
					"content": "別管那傢伙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660750
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660750,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們這次幫了我這麼多，這是謝禮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660751
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660751,
					"content": "唔哇！謝謝迪盧克老爺！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660752
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660752,
					"content": "#雖說已經習慣一個人行動，但有{F#妳}{M#你}們幫忙的感覺也還不錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660753
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660753,
					"content": "今後有什麼需要，可以來找我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660710,
					"content": "放心，我只是在門口運動了一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660711
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4660711,
					"content": "是嗎，可是為什麼偏偏選了這個時候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				}
			]
		},
